IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `prt-payroll`

-- Pay-roll Tax Assessment Act 2002 (WA), with the Pay-roll Tax Act 2002 s 5 and the Pay-roll Tax Assessment Regulations
-- 2003 rr 5-6 -- worked cases, from the seat of the employer-founder.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against
-- a decided case, a RevenueWA ruling or calculator. Cases marked FORMULA rest on formulas the deposited text drops
-- (ss 8(4), 10(2), (4), 11A, 17(3A)), taken from ../../registers/source-bundle/mrdoc_42096.formulas.md.
--
-- Daniel's facts: the life (d044, 1 June 2031) says only "three employees" and "no payroll tax under the state
-- threshold". The salaries are ASSUMPTIONS for the case: $95,000, $85,000 and $75,000 a year ($255,000), with super at
-- 12% ($30,600), so $285,600 a year and $23,800 a month; all work done in Perth; Jarrah is a local nongroup employer
-- (Daniel holds 70% of its voting shares and, by assumption, controls no other business).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table (scratchpad gen_wa_pay-roll-tax-assessment-act-2002_baseline.py). Expected results
-- were written by hand from the text.

